% ok Claude (druhé čítanie) 2026-11-20: p1 s4 b2: LH chord top head between C4 and E4 with ledger below; read as D (Dm, matching RH F-D) — Measured on the scan, the three heads sit at D, A (on the top line) and F. The writer draws the ledger through the top head, as in his other chords, and D minor matches the right hand's F-D.
