% ok Claude (druhé čítanie) 2026-11-20: p1 s5 b1: RH half note drawn at C4 without ledger; read as C — The head is centred exactly at middle-C height; only the ledger is missing, which this writer often leaves out. C over the C7 chord is the natural note.
